{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09183","headline":"假中枉卢二十二书亦称卧疾兼讶李二久不访问以诗答书因亦戏李二 · 韦应物","name":"假中枉卢二十二书亦称卧疾兼讶李二久不访问以诗答书因亦戏李二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微官何事劳趋走，服药闲眠养不才。\n花里棋盘憎鸟污，枕边书卷讶风开。\n故人问讯缘同病，芳月相思阻一杯。\n应笑王戎成俗物，遥持麈尾独徘徊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09183.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09183","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}